WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:10.639
At times, I get a fever and a sore throat.

2
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:17.227
However, after a good night's sleep, I feel much better.

3
00:00:17.228 --> 00:00:19.544
Mom: Are you feeling okay?

4
00:00:19.545 --> 00:00:23.049
Hana: I feel sick, Mom.

5
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.386
Mom: Oh no. You have a fever.

6
00:00:26.387 --> 00:00:29.383
Let me check your temperature.

7
00:00:29.384 --> 00:00:31.739
Mom: You do have a fever.

8
00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:35.622
It's 37.8°C.

9
00:00:35.623 --> 00:00:40.114
Mom: I will get you some medicine.

10
00:00:40.115 --> 00:00:41.273
Mom: Here you go.

11
00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:44.159
Take one pill at a time.

12
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.813
Hana: Can I lie down?

13
00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:50.219
Mom: Sure. You'd better go to bed early.

14
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.600
Hana: But, Mom, I didn't brush my teeth yet.

15
00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:57.943
Mom: Well then, get up and go brush them now.

16
00:00:57.944 --> 00:01:00.229
Don't forget to floss.

17
00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:03.118
Hana: Okay.

18
00:01:03.119 --> 00:01:09.692
No matter how sick or tired we may be, we should always brush our teeth.
